ICON_ONLINE=""
CATEGORY="Meta-distribution"
BASEDOF="Selectable Bedrock-compatible base distro"
DESCRIPTION="Choose a Bedrock-compatible base distro, release, and edition, or reuse a prepared Linux VM config. DistroHopper downloads the selected installer or copies the prepared VM disk, then creates a Bedrock VM for the Bedrock hijack."
HOMEPAGE="https://bedrocklinux.org"
